{"title": "Doom Lobber", "pageid": 28972, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Doom_Lobber", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Doom Lobber</b> is a passive feature that boosts the user's spell attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer gains a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Attack Roll\">Spell Attack Rolls</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Gloves\" title=\"Daredevil Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Gloves\" title=\"Daredevil Gloves\">Daredevil Gloves</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200856\n